<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!--
    The Multitudal icon set: Lucide-style line glyphs on a 24×24 grid, 1.75px stroke, round caps and
    joins, stroked in currentColor. Geometry follows Lucide (github.com/lucide-icons/lucide, ISC), the
    same source the design system's `Icon` component uses — so a glyph here matches the same glyph in
    the web kit.

    No emoji anywhere in the UI, per the brand: energy comes from colour and gradient.
    Rendered by Controls/Icon.cs.
  -->

